 "text": {},
 "captions": [
  {
   "t": [
    0.11,
    3.79
   ],
   "text": "You press *Enter*…\nand the answer starts *typing back*.",
   "kind": "line",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "dark"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    4.51,
    5.91
   ],
   "text": "But here’s the\n*interesting part?*",
   "kind": "line",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "dark"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    6.17,
    9.68
   ],
   "text": "The model doesn’t look up\na finished answer… it *writes it*.",
   "kind": "line",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "light"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    10.09,
    11.85
   ],
   "text": "One *small piece*\nat a time!",
   "kind": "line",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "light"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    12.18,
    15.09
   ],
   "text": "Look, first your message\nis cut into *tokens*.",
   "kind": "fact",
   "src": "anthropic",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "light"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    15.16,
    17.91
   ],
   "text": "A token is about a word…\nor *part of one*.",
   "kind": "fact",
   "src": "openai_tokens",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "light"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    18.3,
    20.92
   ],
   "text": "Then each token becomes\na *list of numbers*.",
   "kind": "fact",
   "src": "vaswani",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "dark"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    21.24,
    26.26
   ],
   "text": "Now *attention*: every word checks\nwhich words matter to it.",
   "kind": "fact",
   "src": "vaswani",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "dark"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    26.71,
    29.84
   ],
   "text": "Then it scores every\npossible *next word*.",
   "kind": "fact",
   "src": "anthropic",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "dark"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    30.01,
    33.52
   ],
   "text": "It picks one… adds it…\nand *guesses again*.",
   "kind": "fact",
   "src": "anthropic",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "dark"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    34.11,
    37.42
   ],
   "text": "That’s why you see it *typing*…\npiece by piece.",
   "kind": "fact",
   "src": "openai_latency",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "light"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    37.65,
    41.12
   ],
   "text": "This is called…",
   "kind": "fact",
   "src": "anthropic",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "light"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    41.65,
    42.88
   ],
   "text": "But there’s a *twist!*",
   "kind": "line",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "dark"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    43.29,
    47.39
   ],
   "text": "It picks the *likely* word…\nnot a checked fact.",
   "kind": "fact",
   "src": "kalai2025",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "dark"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    47.31,
    52.24
   ],
   "text": "That’s why AI can sound *sure*…\nand still be *wrong*.",
   "kind": "fact",
   "src": "kalai2025",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "dark"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    52.09,
    55.64
   ],
   "text": "So AI doesn’t *find* your answer…\nit *writes* it!",
   "kind": "line",
   "style": "pop",
   "mode": "light"
  },
  {
   "t": [
    56.28,
    57.61
   ],
   "text": "Now you see the code.",
   "kind": "line",
   "style": "hidden"
  }
 ],
